# "Color theme..." in the palette lists every theme; typing narrows the list, Enter
# takes the one at the top, and it is kept for next time. Nord's ground is #2e3440
# = (46, 52, 64); a region with no text is all ground.
# frames 8
# expect theme Nord
# expect palette 0
# config-file settings=theme=Nord\n
# pixels 400 200 500 300 46 52 64 10000
1 key p ctrl
2 text color
3 key enter
4 text nord
5 key enter
